### Seller ships a new-product order
POST http://localhost:8088/api/order/13001/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Buyer reads logistics
GET http://localhost:8088/api/logistics/order/13001/trace
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### Buyer confirms receipt
POST http://localhost:8088/api/order/13001/confirm-receive
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
